{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "394795cabd71f577b0327c0f057f51b1b3eae3cd76f09e13e0c8b29aa6694ba2", "ja": "困惑のさざめき", "zh": "困惑的骚动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a98bef1df2042551f4413b32c04df1cafe4673b96fd1796a33b234d21a10f268", "ja": "いよいよ、生徒会選挙の受付が始まった。\n星梨花の姉の美希が生徒会長に立候補し、\nその推薦人が千早だと聞かされる昴。\n初めての選挙で自分達が当事者になっていく\n状況に、1年生達は大きな戸惑いをみせる。", "zh": "终于，学生会选举开始接受报名了。\n星梨花的姐姐美希宣布竞选学生会长，\n昴听说千早是她的推荐人。\n面对自己第一次参加选举、逐渐成为当事人的状况，\n1年级的学生们显得十分困惑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1000_se", "source_sha256": "f98f4cdb4e7b7d62a2dbbd0a5a370f5f947a3f027cc94e2530dd88cc113b1ccd", "ja": "キーンコーン\nカーンコーン", "zh": "叮——咚——\n铛——咚——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1001_seitotachi", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "3498b3945bb3479f202b130ba4212cf27379610a37cd5e583901f1006bfcf1d4", "ja": "おはよー……ん？\nなあ、何かあったの？", "zh": "早上好……嗯？\n喂，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "fab0f7b687a575496eb236df4c1ffeef8d644caf4fb9ec042e81f901935fa9fe", "ja": "昴さん、お姉さまから聞いてないの？　昨日から、\n生徒会選挙の受け付けが始まったのよ。", "zh": "昴，你没听姐姐说吗？从昨天开始，\n学生会选举的报名就已经开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "800a1ad9d3c5886fd352eb28bf4373dbda3e32b5105680f78c7c7ed0ef35efca", "ja": "あのね、星梨花さんのお姉さまの美希さんが、\n生徒会長に立候補したんだって。", "zh": "告诉你哦，星梨花姐姐的姐姐美希学姐，\n参选学生会长了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "b58ead9abf92426ff14dd299094d1fd1202f0979fe092d12c32ee74841e93161", "ja": "えっ、星梨花のお姉さまが！？\nすっげー！！", "zh": "诶，星梨花的姐姐大人！？\n太厉害了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "41ad7a87cc41f4aa1216e76a7a5a3270dae86dbb91ef57fb44df2a0a97801856", "ja": "あ、じゃなくて……す、すごいですわ！\n応援しなくちゃだね、星梨花！", "zh": "啊，不对……真、真厉害啊！得给她加油才行，对吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1cf9f913a620ae804b2c273548d5031134a2fab14ff30ccb625f83264589c01", "ja": "ええ……でも……。", "zh": "嗯……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "d89ec30a1c5b1d616ef597a18879951f28ff0d2da8c339f8ab4542b63abe7879", "ja": "もう、昴さんたら鈍いわね。\n美希さんは生徒会長に立候補したのよ？", "zh": "真是的，昴你也太迟钝了吧。\n美希她可是参选了学生会长哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "c63c8e0236d43ef90f554f2b85e89e98a5f6c0054cc2c1de5ebd3d26f5e527b2", "ja": "つまり、海美さんと対決することになるの。\nそれに昴さんだって、すこしは関係あるのよ？", "zh": "也就是说，要和海美一决胜负。\n而且，这件事和昴也多少有点关系哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "a9d37725c8c6922dcec21f5f9bd61055b1b6a76b696cbd5d55347ee803f47497", "ja": "わたしが？　なんで？", "zh": "我？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "f485a8d0e951e0a4666a10b6399c3ad1ce96ec25116dc6ce6e61c6229a97cbd8", "ja": "美希お姉さまの推薦人は、千早さんなんです。", "zh": "美希姐姐的推荐人，是千早姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "6a73afd4046794655f2d4c7e157db71eda4be13808c70cd1062b3dd44f7537ca", "ja": "えっ。\n千早さんが……？", "zh": "诶。\n千早小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "dd5bb096d9531e854114e2ba7bf70926f03c59e61997a7d00a420d093caba847", "ja": "他には、副会長にミス・デイジーの妹の\n茜さんが立候補されたそうよ。", "zh": "听说还有，茜同学也参选了副会长，她是Miss Daisy的妹妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a2ed93b67dc26b9fb30b3614d7729758d8ed3abb7b20d6160e7948ae06c7e50", "ja": "現役の生徒会役員で、ミス・アルメリアの妹の\n恵美さんも、副会長で出るって噂だし……。", "zh": "听说现任学生会干部、阿尔梅莉亚小姐的妹妹惠美也要竞选副会长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "34de84f6a3fef53b4b555f30a29dd5cc55528b3dcb5a1161351cf9852b579473", "ja": "あ～、何かこんがらがってきた……。", "zh": "啊～，感觉有点搞不清楚了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "503041e592b636a3676933c899029b6f02d7da67b10475545c3bc1b1b1c60156", "ja": "とにかく、今年の生徒会選挙は予想がつかないわ。\n近年稀に見る混戦なのよ。", "zh": "总之，今年的学生会选举真是让人捉摸不透。\n这是近年来少见的激烈混战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f32e2e840d972fa35ef8bf572f731574004f63f862ec650c05f0e1750c881ed", "ja": "そうなんだ……。星梨花は、\n自分のお姉さまを応援するんだよね？", "zh": "这样啊……星梨花会为自己的姐姐加油，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "8b5f7c4e8bec21c4cc0f58483f5d1f1be7716046dde8f17be98737069eb82f77", "ja": "はい。結果がどうなるかはわかりませんが、\nわたしは、美希お姉さまを応援します。", "zh": "是的。虽然不知道结果会如何，\n但我会为美希姐姐加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "56187445906b29d2df7aa7ba12ae2eb342a0c20ee157582d6e3fad9754d013c2", "ja": "わたしは……。", "zh": "我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "32a023808e14ea6f1c036575e766a4b63ad2294976c39f40e27a66acc19252e8", "ja": "……あのさ、育。生徒会役員は、やる気があるなら\n誰が立候補してもいいんだって。1年生でも。", "zh": "……那个，育。听说学生会干部只要有干劲，谁都可以参选。就算是1年级的学生也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "c3cf0ea5c44033a7076d438db1ef56fc26a38bf9c67aec62847be6c693f33c88", "ja": "それから、応援する人が違ったとしても、\n普段どおり仲良くしていいんだって。可憐さんが。", "zh": "而且，可怜说了，就算支持的人不同，也可以像平时一样好好相处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "8917e075623644378ecd33ca0950c268d413fff95a3b152cbbe022ac6be89496", "ja": "あ……。\nそっか。そうだよね。", "zh": "啊……  \n这样啊。确实是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1023_se", "source_sha256": "f98f4cdb4e7b7d62a2dbbd0a5a370f5f947a3f027cc94e2530dd88cc113b1ccd", "ja": "キーンコーン\nカーンコーン", "zh": "叮——咚——\n铛——咚——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "6b1b4a3dd0d7e113d6a3f26d9a293fc212e59b519c29828444e0b397ddf32164", "ja": "あ……、チャイム鳴っちゃった。\nわたし、教室に戻るね。", "zh": "啊……，上课铃响了。\n我先回教室了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_03_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "da3c7a676aff666c437525a86cad003e829a48a55dc342ba6878c8002aea1845", "ja": "昴さん、その……ありがとう。", "zh": "昴，那个……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
